A trip for club members and the public to TVS&rsquo;s dark observing site. Meet at the corner of Mines and Tesla Roads. The caravan to the site leaves at 5:30 pm sharp. Bring $3 for site admission.&nbsp; Make sure you have a full tank/charge in your car.
&nbsp;
